<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Posts on AI驱动数字化转型</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/posts/</link><description>Recent content in Posts on AI驱动数字化转型</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/posts/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>AI进厂的三次认知升级</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/ai%E8%BF%9B%E5%8E%82%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%A4%E7%9F%A5%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7/</link><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/ai%E8%BF%9B%E5%8E%82%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%A4%E7%9F%A5%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7/</guid><description>AI不是买大模型，是解决真问题。让机器读懂你的工厂，把老师傅的门道沉淀成行业语义资产。</description></item><item><title>从数据胡扯说起：谈企业数据清洗</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E4%BB%8E%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E8%83%A1%E6%89%AF%E8%AF%B4%E8%B5%B7%E8%B0%88%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%B8%85%E6%B4%97/</link><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E4%BB%8E%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E8%83%A1%E6%89%AF%E8%AF%B4%E8%B5%B7%E8%B0%88%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%B8%85%E6%B4%97/</guid><description>企业数据清洗是数字化转型的关键节点。从制定规则、构建平台到建立质量体系，把低质量数据变成可靠的决策依据。</description></item><item><title>几十家国央企的AI落地，大多还没走出局部智能</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E5%87%A0%E5%8D%81%E5%AE%B6%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%AE%E4%BC%81%E7%9A%84ai%E8%90%BD%E5%9C%B0%E5%A4%A7%E5%A4%9A%E8%BF%98%E6%B2%A1%E8%B5%B0%E5%87%BA%E5%B1%80%E9%83%A8%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD/</link><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E5%87%A0%E5%8D%81%E5%AE%B6%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%AE%E4%BC%81%E7%9A%84ai%E8%90%BD%E5%9C%B0%E5%A4%A7%E5%A4%9A%E8%BF%98%E6%B2%A1%E8%B5%B0%E5%87%BA%E5%B1%80%E9%83%A8%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD/</guid><description>以评审专家视角，审完一批大型国企的AI落地案例后，一个判断浮出来：大多数企业还停留在流程线上化和局部智能，真正走到AI原生的寥寥无几，而卡住它们的，从来不是技术。</description></item><item><title>工厂本体 factory-ontology：本体问答工具开源，让中小企业台账学会说话</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82%E6%9C%AC%E4%BD%93-factory-ontology%E6%9C%AC%E4%BD%93%E9%97%AE%E7%AD%94%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90%E8%AE%A9%E4%B8%AD%E5%B0%8F%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E5%8F%B0%E8%B4%A6%E5%AD%A6%E4%BC%9A%E8%AF%B4%E8%AF%9D/</link><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82%E6%9C%AC%E4%BD%93-factory-ontology%E6%9C%AC%E4%BD%93%E9%97%AE%E7%AD%94%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90%E8%AE%A9%E4%B8%AD%E5%B0%8F%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E5%8F%B0%E8%B4%A6%E5%AD%A6%E4%BC%9A%E8%AF%B4%E8%AF%9D/</guid><description>数据躺在MES、ERP、Excel台账里，业务人员不会SQL，老师傅凭经验拍脑袋。factory-ontology用本体给数据划定语义边界，让机器在边界内确定性回答，让台账变成能对话、能溯源、能沉淀的资产。</description></item></channel></rss>